# Keep LF in every working tree, including Windows checkouts. Drizzle records each migration by a
# hash of the SQL file's bytes, so CRLF copies look like different migrations ("migrations pending"),
# and CRLF shell scripts break inside the Linux container.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
